# Keep the brain image build context small (deploy/brain/Dockerfile builds from
# the repo root). Source + manifests + lockfile are copied explicitly; everything
# heavy/derived is excluded.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-electron
**/.next
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/build
**/out
**/release
**/coverage
.git
.github
.codex
.claude
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Local/dev-only state that must never enter an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.npmrc
**/.yarnrc
**/.yarnrc.yml
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.pub
**/.brainrouter
**/.brainrouter/**
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
AWSPrep
openSrc
Tasks.md
walkthrough.md
